(5766951, 839575, 28427, '<td valign="top">Some of them are real artists.  Some photographers have an eye for artists and know how to share their art.  Thank you for sharing this little piece of art with us.</td>', 'Some of them are real artists.  Some photographers have an eye for artists and know how to share their art.  Thank you for sharing this little piece of art with us.', '2009-12-14 13:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
