(5767083, 839019, 101306, '<td valign="top">like the mmody grey, slightly tilted?</td>', 'like the mmody grey, slightly tilted?', '2009-12-14 15:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767086, 839541, 554, '<td valign="top">You are so lucky to have sooo many to choose from. :)<br/>Well done.</td>', 'You are so lucky to have sooo many to choose from. :)Well done.', '2009-12-14 15:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767087, 839426, 83650, '<td valign="top">I wish the buildings were a little closer to view properly, otherwise I''m mainly stuck looking at the foreground.  The blacks in the clouds on the right are a little weird for me when compared to the left side.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'I wish the buildings were a little closer to view properly, otherwise I''m mainly stuck looking at the foreground.  The blacks in the clouds on the right are a little weird for me when compared to the left side.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767088, 839572, 83650, '<td valign="top">Are the red railings significant in any way?  Can''t figure out why the shot is in B&amp;W except for the railings.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Are the red railings significant in any way?  Can''t figure out why the shot is in B&W except for the railings.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767090, 839550, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying looking at this.  Love the deeply saturated colors, grain and chaos.</td>', 'I''m really enjoying looking at this.  Love the deeply saturated colors, grain and chaos.', '2009-12-14 15:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767092, 839277, 43565, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and textures of the building. The cement in the foreground is very distracting.</td>', 'Love the colors and textures of the building. The cement in the foreground is very distracting.', '2009-12-14 15:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767095, 839583, 83650, '<td valign="top">I mainly see graffiti rather than decay - unless you meant for the graffiti to mean some sort of decay in civilization.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'I mainly see graffiti rather than decay - unless you meant for the graffiti to mean some sort of decay in civilization.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767096, 839692, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the composition OK, but the exposure really sets it off, very nice mixture of tones.  Back to add that by "sets off" I mean in a very good way :) 9</td>', 'I like the composition OK, but the exposure really sets it off, very nice mixture of tones.  Back to add that by "sets off" I mean in a very good way :) 9', '2009-12-14 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767097, 838633, 83650, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit flat on contrast except for the upper portion of the window.  B&amp;W might have been a good option for this since the colors aren''t very catchy.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Seems a bit flat on contrast except for the upper portion of the window.  B&W might have been a good option for this since the colors aren''t very catchy.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767099, 839330, 68256, '<td valign="top">The b/w tones are not supporting the message to me.  I''m drawn to the white shoes and streaks of sun on the back wall, but not sure what they add to the story.  I usually assume it is my own ignorance in cases like this :)</td>', 'The b/w tones are not supporting the message to me.  I''m drawn to the white shoes and streaks of sun on the back wall, but not sure what they add to the story.  I usually assume it is my own ignorance in cases like this :)', '2009-12-14 15:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767101, 839693, 83650, '<td valign="top">I can only assume this might be a subway car or bus?  A wider perspective would have helped this shot especially when it''s tough to make out exactly what it is.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'I can only assume this might be a subway car or bus?  A wider perspective would have helped this shot especially when it''s tough to make out exactly what it is.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767108, 839472, 83650, '<td valign="top">Decay doesn''t come to mind after looking at this for a while.  I''m just seeing graffiti mainly.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Decay doesn''t come to mind after looking at this for a while.  I''m just seeing graffiti mainly.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767109, 839426, 68256, '<td valign="top">I think you have succeeded wonderfully in depicting the decay that goes un-photographed by typical landscape photographers. It adds so much meaning that it is shot in the traditional landscape mood and with great landscape techniques.  One cannot avoid the message.</td>', 'I think you have succeeded wonderfully in depicting the decay that goes un-photographed by typical landscape photographers. It adds so much meaning that it is shot in the traditional landscape mood and with great landscape techniques.  One cannot avoid the message.', '2009-12-14 15:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767110, 838655, 83650, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped out the building to the right since it appears like it is being used.  A vertical crop of just the left side of this building would have looked pretty good - you have bushes coming out of the windows and peeling paint above the word Jet.  Punching up the colors would have helped a lot too.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'I might have cropped out the building to the right since it appears like it is being used.  A vertical crop of just the left side of this building would have looked pretty good - you have bushes coming out of the windows and peeling paint above the word Jet.  Punching up the colors would have helped a lot too.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767111, 839550, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good luck with the dnmc voters.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Good luck with the dnmc voters.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767119, 839418, 83650, '<td valign="top">The title isn''t quite true, is it?  ;-)  I don''t see any broken windows or the lower part of the building crumbling.  Title aside, good find.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'The title isn''t quite true, is it?  ;-)  I don''t see any broken windows or the lower part of the building crumbling.  Title aside, good find.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767120, 839414, 68256, '<td valign="top">It is urban decay but I find the composition lacking something.  I wished I could put my finger on it for you.  Perhaps if there were more going on in the foreground tracks to place the focus on and throw the background out of focus.  I will give it a 6 because I see merit in the photo and nothing technically wrong, it just doesn''t work for me. Sorry.</td>', 'It is urban decay but I find the composition lacking something.  I wished I could put my finger on it for you.  Perhaps if there were more going on in the foreground tracks to place the focus on and throw the background out of focus.  I will give it a 6 because I see merit in the photo and nothing technically wrong, it just doesn''t work for me. Sorry.', '2009-12-14 15:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767123, 839619, 83650, '<td valign="top">Overuse of HDR/tone mapping software IMO.  Subject could have done well on its own without the over-processed look.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Overuse of HDR/tone mapping software IMO.  Subject could have done well on its own without the over-processed look.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767134, 839538, 83650, '<td valign="top">Not as strong as a competitor compared to other decay shots in this challenge.  Why didn''t you use the 800px limit?  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Not as strong as a competitor compared to other decay shots in this challenge.  Why didn''t you use the 800px limit?  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767138, 839574, 83650, '<td valign="top">I imagine you''re getting points knocked off because of the "unable to determine if this is urban" vote.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'I imagine you''re getting points knocked off because of the "unable to determine if this is urban" vote.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767139, 839479, 83650, '<td valign="top">From the viewpoint of art, you''re screwed on the "decay" vote.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'From the viewpoint of art, you''re screwed on the "decay" vote.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767141, 839622, 83650, '<td valign="top">Great detail and good use of sharpening...but the off-tilt was the first thing that jumped out at me.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Great detail and good use of sharpening...but the off-tilt was the first thing that jumped out at me.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767146, 839277, 83650, '<td valign="top">The rotation is skewed, and I''m not sure why you decided to go with what appears to be a watercolor type processing on the primary buildings.  That for me kills the shot in showing their decay even more.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'The rotation is skewed, and I''m not sure why you decided to go with what appears to be a watercolor type processing on the primary buildings.  That for me kills the shot in showing their decay even more.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 15:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767148, 839537, 83650, '<td valign="top">You saw crosswords, I saw Sudoku. :-)  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'You saw crosswords, I saw Sudoku. :-)  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767151, 838486, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like the earth tones of this building and its character.  Some negetives for me that bring down my score.  1. a lack of detail that almost looks like post processing, like a noise reduction or something. I realize that could be the subject matter.  2.  Since the subject is the building itself I would have liked to seen more of the structure.  Particularly at least one entire window surrounded by the bricks.  3.  I don''t like the large amount of black in the lower left.  I can see a little detail there but not enough to add to the photo. 4.  There is banding in the sky.  5. Probably most important for me is subject story.  Think about the photo as a sentence, what is the main subject?  What are the predicates that support the main subject?  With all that being said, it ain''t a bad photo at all.  6</td>', 'I really like the earth tones of this building and its character.  Some negetives for me that bring down my score.  1. a lack of detail that almost looks like post processing, like a noise reduction or something. I realize that could be the subject matter.  2.  Since the subject is the building itself I would have liked to seen more of the structure.  Particularly at least one entire window surrounded by the bricks.  3.  I don''t like the large amount of black in the lower left.  I can see a little detail there but not enough to add to the photo. 4.  There is banding in the sky.  5. Probably most important for me is subject story.  Think about the photo as a sentence, what is the main subject?  What are the predicates that support the main subject?  With all that being said, it ain''t a bad photo at all.  6', '2009-12-14 16:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767153, 839263, 83650, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft on the lower and left side.  Not sure if that was a focus issue or a long zoom without a tripod.(slight shake?)  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft on the lower and left side.  Not sure if that was a focus issue or a long zoom without a tripod.(slight shake?)  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767155, 839607, 83650, '<td valign="top">Locust or scorpion?  Can''t tell and I''m not sure what it has to do with urban decay.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Locust or scorpion?  Can''t tell and I''m not sure what it has to do with urban decay.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767157, 839451, 83650, '<td valign="top">Could have used a CW rotate to the right a little - maybe 1.5 degrees.  Was the focal point supposed to be the column in the middle?  If so, a wider aperture should have been used depending on the lens to help isolate the back wall more.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Could have used a CW rotate to the right a little - maybe 1.5 degrees.  Was the focal point supposed to be the column in the middle?  If so, a wider aperture should have been used depending on the lens to help isolate the back wall more.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767163, 839590, 68256, '<td valign="top">I must admit I am not getting this.  Is it about the car that is damaged and has found its niche behind a fence?  Is it about the night light who''s niche is to light up the cars (which wouldn''t be decay I guess).  <br/> <br/>On top of that I don''t find the composition very interesting either.  I do like the lighting and the interesting things on the side of the building.  Is that a white angel with red highlights?  I just think this scene had lots of potential but you didn''t pick any one thing to concentrate on.</td>', 'I must admit I am not getting this.  Is it about the car that is damaged and has found its niche behind a fence?  Is it about the night light who''s niche is to light up the cars (which wouldn''t be decay I guess).   On top of that I don''t find the composition very interesting either.  I do like the lighting and the interesting things on the side of the building.  Is that a white angel with red highlights?  I just think this scene had lots of potential but you didn''t pick any one thing to concentrate on.', '2009-12-14 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767166, 839664, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject and lighting.  The crop is a little awkward to me and I''m getting an umbalanced feeling looking at it.  I love the warm earth tones in the old boat and the grass along the shore.  It would have been great (although perhaps not possible) if you could have isolated one aspect of the slow death.</td>', 'Very interesting subject and lighting.  The crop is a little awkward to me and I''m getting an umbalanced feeling looking at it.  I love the warm earth tones in the old boat and the grass along the shore.  It would have been great (although perhaps not possible) if you could have isolated one aspect of the slow death.', '2009-12-14 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767168, 839593, 83650, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I see more vines that decay.  But I''m weird like that because I think vines on buildings look cool.  Couldn''t you have broken a few windows to bump your score up a few tenths of a point? lol   No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'To be honest, I see more vines that decay.  But I''m weird like that because I think vines on buildings look cool.  Couldn''t you have broken a few windows to bump your score up a few tenths of a point? lol   No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767171, 838659, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot.  A nighttime scene could have looked pretty cool with some remote flash work (and gels!)  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Good clean shot.  A nighttime scene could have looked pretty cool with some remote flash work (and gels!)  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767172, 838177, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good decay, meets challenge quite well.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Good decay, meets challenge quite well.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767173, 839641, 83650, '<td valign="top">Wow, in the running for the brown I assume.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Wow, in the running for the brown I assume.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767174, 838975, 83650, '<td valign="top">Personally, I see artwork, not decay.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Personally, I see artwork, not decay.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767175, 839488, 83686, '<td valign="top">This is way too grainy...plus the theme is not in keeping with the assignment.</td>', 'This is way too grainy...plus the theme is not in keeping with the assignment.', '2009-12-14 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767176, 839591, 68256, '<td valign="top">Interesting compostion.  I like the tone of it, very gray and sad and evokes emotion.  This is a strange question but is that stick in the lower right a clone?  Looks like 2 identical sticks LOL.  It doesn''t matter, just wondering.</td>', 'Interesting compostion.  I like the tone of it, very gray and sad and evokes emotion.  This is a strange question but is that stick in the lower right a clone?  Looks like 2 identical sticks LOL.  It doesn''t matter, just wondering.', '2009-12-14 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767177, 839641, 83686, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept but the shot is uninteresting and too blurry.</td>', 'I understand the concept but the shot is uninteresting and too blurry.', '2009-12-14 16:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767178, 839536, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good blend of graffiti and decay.  Works well together.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Good blend of graffiti and decay.  Works well together.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767179, 839427, 68256, '<td valign="top">Man that is a scary place, looks like an old hospital, jail or psychiatric ward.  Great range of tones and "feeling" in this.  Love the 3 windows down the hall which provides me an escape from this wretched place.</td>', 'Man that is a scary place, looks like an old hospital, jail or psychiatric ward.  Great range of tones and "feeling" in this.  Love the 3 windows down the hall which provides me an escape from this wretched place.', '2009-12-14 16:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767180, 839488, 83650, '<td valign="top">Another shot in the running for the brown I see...  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Another shot in the running for the brown I see...  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767186, 839542, 83650, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just the processing, or lack thereof, but this shot doesn''t really stand out above other shots in this challenge.  The small crop doesn''t help either - why didn''t you use 800px?  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just the processing, or lack thereof, but this shot doesn''t really stand out above other shots in this challenge.  The small crop doesn''t help either - why didn''t you use 800px?  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767187, 839399, 83650, '<td valign="top">Different subject matter than what was expected(good).  But the decay seems minimal to me.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Different subject matter than what was expected(good).  But the decay seems minimal to me.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767188, 839401, 83650, '<td valign="top">Good, honest portrait.  Can fit the challenge well depending on one''s point of view.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Good, honest portrait.  Can fit the challenge well depending on one''s point of view.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767189, 839629, 83650, '<td valign="top">Getting above the fence or shooting through it would have been better IMO.  But it is very sharp and shows great detail.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Getting above the fence or shooting through it would have been better IMO.  But it is very sharp and shows great detail.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2009-12-14 16:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
