(5767254, 839448, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like this subject and the colors, but not too crazy about the HDR treatment. I also like the fact that I can''t tell if I''m looking at the inside of this place, all the way through, or reflections of outside, adds to the suspense.</td>', 'I like this subject and the colors, but not too crazy about the HDR treatment. I also like the fact that I can''t tell if I''m looking at the inside of this place, all the way through, or reflections of outside, adds to the suspense.', '2009-12-14 17:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767259, 839619, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is way overboard for my taste on the HDR.  I kinda like what is going on, but just can''t get over the processing.  I''ll go ahead and give it a 6 for composition and challenge relevence though.  I particularly like that little red face stareing at me from the lower left corner.</td>', 'This is way overboard for my taste on the HDR.  I kinda like what is going on, but just can''t get over the processing.  I''ll go ahead and give it a 6 for composition and challenge relevence though.  I particularly like that little red face stareing at me from the lower left corner.', '2009-12-14 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5767263, 839496, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like this composition and placement of the subject.  It could have stood for some curves adjustment to draw those great clouds out (push the highlights) and create better seperation for the art and wall.  Good shot though.</td>', 'I like this composition and placement of the subject.  It could have stood for some curves adjustment to draw those great clouds out (push the highlights) and create better seperation for the art and wall.  Good shot though.', '2009-12-14 18:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
