(5767379, 839574, 108982, '<td valign="top">believe it or not this started as a 5.  I kept going back to it and every time I saw it I liked it better and better.  It has the most fitting title of all the entries.  I don''t even know why, but I love this photo.  great composition, love the single tone post-processing, love the bleached worn look that the whites produce. As a single point of criticism, i would have shifted left a hair to better utilize the rule of thirds and dilute the lower, left dark corner.  very, very well done... now its a 10</td>', 'believe it or not this started as a 5.  I kept going back to it and every time I saw it I liked it better and better.  It has the most fitting title of all the entries.  I don''t even know why, but I love this photo.  great composition, love the single tone post-processing, love the bleached worn look that the whites produce. As a single point of criticism, i would have shifted left a hair to better utilize the rule of thirds and dilute the lower, left dark corner.  very, very well done... now its a 10', '2009-12-14 21:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
