(5769194, 839513, 44378, '<td valign="top">The colors pop here but it''s too dark. Also, I feel you have two subjects that compete for attention - the dark building and the artwork on the left.</td>', 'The colors pop here but it''s too dark. Also, I feel you have two subjects that compete for attention - the dark building and the artwork on the left.', '2009-12-16 11:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5769203, 839536, 44378, '<td valign="top">Good use of the fisheye here. There is some nice movement going on in this image but I feel it could be enhanced with a subject (model) wither at the top or bottom of the stairs. When leading your viewers through your image, consider where their eyes will stop and give them something interesting to look at and ponder, maybe a woman weeping at the bottom of the stairs suggesting she is a product of this harsh environment she lives in, a mop and bucket on the landing to the right suggesting someone is about to clean this mess up. It should tell a story.</td>', 'Good use of the fisheye here. There is some nice movement going on in this image but I feel it could be enhanced with a subject (model) wither at the top or bottom of the stairs. When leading your viewers through your image, consider where their eyes will stop and give them something interesting to look at and ponder, maybe a woman weeping at the bottom of the stairs suggesting she is a product of this harsh environment she lives in, a mop and bucket on the landing to the right suggesting someone is about to clean this mess up. It should tell a story.', '2009-12-16 11:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5769207, 839338, 44378, '<td valign="top">HDR? Nice color. When I view it I feel a little closed in. Maybe pull back a bit and show the full window might look more interesting. There is a cable in the upper left corner of the image that distracts a bit from the overall image. Maybe consider a crop here.</td>', 'HDR? Nice color. When I view it I feel a little closed in. Maybe pull back a bit and show the full window might look more interesting. There is a cable in the upper left corner of the image that distracts a bit from the overall image. Maybe consider a crop here.', '2009-12-16 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5769212, 839678, 44378, '<td valign="top">Nice color, almost metallic in feel. Your image might be helped with adding a subject or person sitting in the background maybe just beyond the gutter on the right. Just an idea. I like that the sun is just peaking above on the left. Nice touch.</td>', 'Nice color, almost metallic in feel. Your image might be helped with adding a subject or person sitting in the background maybe just beyond the gutter on the right. Just an idea. I like that the sun is just peaking above on the left. Nice touch.', '2009-12-16 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
