(5771535, 839399, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very neat subject, but it seems a bit dark and underexposed. A more off center composition might make it more interesting, too.</td>', 'Very neat subject, but it seems a bit dark and underexposed. A more off center composition might make it more interesting, too.', '2009-12-18 15:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771539, 839497, 49788, '<td valign="top">Neat subject and repeated geometry. The ominous sky is also great. However, the lighting is very flat, so there''s not a lot of variation in tone. Also, I might have cropped out more of the foreground, as it''s not that interesting. Also, it seems like the image was maybe oversharpened?</td>', 'Neat subject and repeated geometry. The ominous sky is also great. However, the lighting is very flat, so there''s not a lot of variation in tone. Also, I might have cropped out more of the foreground, as it''s not that interesting. Also, it seems like the image was maybe oversharpened?', '2009-12-18 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771568, 839689, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image! There''s so much to look at: the people, the sign, the stoplight, the door, the telephone booth, the building, the wires. Nice tones. Love the spot of yellow and red. Makes the image pop for me. Excellent sharpness.</td>', 'Wonderful image! There''s so much to look at: the people, the sign, the stoplight, the door, the telephone booth, the building, the wires. Nice tones. Love the spot of yellow and red. Makes the image pop for me. Excellent sharpness.', '2009-12-18 16:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771569, 839338, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very neat repeated pattern of the criss crossing bars, the window pane, the reflection of the bars. Nice. Love the green color.</td>', 'Very neat repeated pattern of the criss crossing bars, the window pane, the reflection of the bars. Nice. Love the green color.', '2009-12-18 16:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771572, 839633, 49788, '<td valign="top">Almost a great image for me. The repeated patterns, interesting colors (blue, pink, orange from the rust) make for a great subject. However, I find there''s a bit too much going on, and some of the detail in the scene gets lost because it gets so small. Perhaps a tighter crop on the most interesting part of the image (lower right?) to force more attention?</td>', 'Almost a great image for me. The repeated patterns, interesting colors (blue, pink, orange from the rust) make for a great subject. However, I find there''s a bit too much going on, and some of the detail in the scene gets lost because it gets so small. Perhaps a tighter crop on the most interesting part of the image (lower right?) to force more attention?', '2009-12-18 16:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771576, 839401, 49788, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait. Nicely composed, and the blue, yellow, red, and then bright red spots make for an interesting backdrop. I think of something different for Urban Decay -- namely, buildings -- but this isn''t far off the mark.<br/> <br/>My one criticism would be the artifacts of selective dodging, e.g., around the hands, and behind his back / head. Other than that, a very successful image.</td>', 'I really like this portrait. Nicely composed, and the blue, yellow, red, and then bright red spots make for an interesting backdrop. I think of something different for Urban Decay -- namely, buildings -- but this isn''t far off the mark. My one criticism would be the artifacts of selective dodging, e.g., around the hands, and behind his back / head. Other than that, a very successful image.', '2009-12-18 16:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771579, 839628, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wow! I don''t know how heavily processed this is, but I really like the effect of the green. Really striking. Nice tones in the back, and good detail / sharpness in the garbage and graffiti. A really nice image.</td>', 'Wow! I don''t know how heavily processed this is, but I really like the effect of the green. Really striking. Nice tones in the back, and good detail / sharpness in the garbage and graffiti. A really nice image.', '2009-12-18 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771580, 839316, 49788, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition. I think this could have been a really nice image if it were lit differently. It looks like you used a single flash, which makes the image very flat.</td>', 'Good subject and composition. I think this could have been a really nice image if it were lit differently. It looks like you used a single flash, which makes the image very flat.', '2009-12-18 16:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5771590, 839426, 112963, '<td valign="top">love the clouds in this photo. the clouds themselves look as if they are decaying too. great job!</td>', 'love the clouds in this photo. the clouds themselves look as if they are decaying too. great job!', '2009-12-18 16:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
