(5773809, 839607, 53814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sonniejake:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cool shot, but I''m having a hard time figuring out how it fits into the challenge.  Maybe if the title was more informative (remember, not all of your viewers read the Christian bible). </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, Sondra. Actually, I''m not a bible reader either. After I determined the rotated avocado was, in reality, a grasshopper, I googled "locust bible quote" to come up with the title.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-21 20:30:53.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by sonniejake: Very cool shot, but I''m having a hard time figuring out how it fits into the challenge.  Maybe if the title was more informative (remember, not all of your viewers read the Christian bible).  Thanks, Sondra. Actually, I''m not a bible reader either. After I determined the rotated avocado was, in reality, a grasshopper, I googled "locust bible quote" to come up with the title.', '2009-12-21 00:41:24.000000', '2009-12-21 20:30:53.000000', 0),
